model list.\n\n## Evidence\n\n`src/rebar/llm/evals/provider_parity.py:555-565` already probes a Bedrock id bare and with `temperature=0`. The bug's scratch probe (Converse, maxTokens 16, bare / temperature 0 / temperature 1.0 / topP 0.9) classified 17 ids across Anthropic, OpenAI, Moonshot, Amazon, Meta, Mistral and DeepSeek in under 2 minutes.\n\n## Approach (to be designed)\n\nExtend the parity probe to run every model id named in `rebar.toml`, `.github/llm-providers/*.toml` and the capability tables against Bedrock before a release (a `docs/releasing.md` step, runnable locally, portable — not CI-only), and fail when a probed result disagrees with `capabilities_for`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A documented command probes every configured/listed model id and reports disagreements with the capability table (exit non-zero on disagreement).\n- [ ] `docs/releasing.md` lists it as a pre-release step.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["llm","bedrock","release"],"ticket_id":"2bc8-3758-a4b9-47f0","ticket_type":"story","title":"Pre-release probe of configured models' sampling-parameter acceptance","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["4bcdadfa-9cd1-43a8-8a9d-8345660cac5e","39011798-b216-48e1-9b0d-52bce5114ac5"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794424228445522697,"uuid":"3eda2c7f-f865-4727-844a-988c7327bc80"}